cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this methodology preview, please cite the software metadata below and state
  that v0.1 is not suitable for model ranking.
title: "coding-agent-eval: BugSeed v0.1 methodology preview"
version: 0.1.0
type: software
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A contamination-resistant vertical slice for evaluating whether coding agents discover
  deliberately seeded defects under reproducible sandbox conditions. Version 0.1 contains
  two fixtures and eight mutations and is methodology evidence, not a representative model
  benchmark or leaderboard.
authors:
  - name: kuotunyu
keywords:
  - coding agents
  - LLM evaluation
  - software engineering benchmark
  - seeded defects
  - reproducibility
